{"pageWidth":594,"pageHeight":783,"items":[{"text":"Si-Mohamed et al","rect":[489.447,744.74,545.9429999999999,752.74],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Radiology:","rect":[48,21.46,77.491,28.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Volume 300: Number 1—July 2021","rect":[79.122,21.46,171.9126,28.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"n","rect":[173.9115,22.12,176.13549999999998,26.12],"fontSize":4},{"text":"radiology.rsna.org","rect":[178.1355,21.46,226.26680000000005,28.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"101","rect":[534.0479,21.24,545.9999,29.24],"fontSize":8},{"text":"To compare the aortic wall enhancement between time","rect":[60,206.6501,288.001,216.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"points before injection and 2 days after injection, a two-tailed","rect":[48,194.6501,287.97,204.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"paired","rect":[48,182.6501,71.95,192.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"t","rect":[74.25999999999999,182.6501,77.1,192.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"test was performed in the atherosclerotic animal group","rect":[79.41,182.6501,287.97900000000016,192.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"(","rect":[47.99999999999999,170.6501,51.199999999999996,180.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"n","rect":[51.199999999999996,170.6501,56.209999999999994,180.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"= 7) and the control group (","rect":[58.709999999999994,170.6501,167.209,180.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"n","rect":[167.209,170.6501,172.219,180.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"= 4).","rect":[174.719,170.6501,192.91899999999998,180.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"To assess the correlation between the macrophage area mea-","rect":[59.99999999999999,158.6501,288.01900000000006,168.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"sured in immunostained sections and both the concentration","rect":[47.99999999999999,146.6501,288.00100000000003,156.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"of gold and the attenuation measured in the corresponding","rect":[47.99999999999999,134.6501,288.0090000000002,144.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"PCCT sections (","rect":[47.99999999999999,122.6501,112.22,132.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"n","rect":[112.22,122.6501,117.23,132.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"= 35), a two-tailed Pearson correlation coef-","rect":[119.571,122.6501,287.91100000000006,132.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ficient was calculated.","rect":[47.99999999999999,110.6501,131.70000000000002,120.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"The nominal level of significance for all tests was","rect":[59.99999999999999,98.6501,250.36,108.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"P","rect":[253.29999999999987,98.6501,258.8199999999999,108.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":",","rect":[261.72999999999996,98.6501,270.05999999999995,108.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":".05.","rect":[272.99999999999994,98.6501,287.99999999999994,108.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Prism software (version 7.0a, GraphPad Software) was used for","rect":[47.99999999999994,86.6501,287.96900000000005,96.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"statistical analysis.","rect":[47.99999999999994,74.6501,117.56999999999994,84.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"A more detailed description of the methods is given in Ap-","rect":[59.99999999999994,62.650099999999995,288.0040000000001,72.6501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"pendix E1 (online).","rect":[47.99999999999994,50.650099999999995,123.35999999999994,60.650099999999995],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Results","rect":[306,208.3042,338.20799999999997,220.3042],"fontSize":12},{"text":"Seven","rect":[306,194.7442,328.2,204.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"atherosclerotic","rect":[334.99999999999994,194.7442,390.75899999999996,204.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"New","rect":[397.55899999999997,194.7442,415.70799999999997,204.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Zealand","rect":[422.508,194.7442,453.70799999999997,204.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"white","rect":[460.50800000000004,194.7442,481.85800000000006,204.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"rabbits","rect":[488.658,194.7442,514.888,204.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"(mean","rect":[521.688,194.7442,546.008,204.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"weight, 3.8 kg","rect":[306,182.7442,364.465,192.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"6","rect":[368.68499999999995,182.7442,377.01499999999993,192.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"0.5 [standard deviation]; mean age, 34.5","rect":[381.23499999999996,182.7442,546.024,192.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"weeks) and four control nonatherosclerotic New Zealand white","rect":[306,170.7442,546.019,180.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"rabbits (mean weight, 3.4 kg","rect":[306,158.7442,416.25900000000007,168.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"6","rect":[418.67900000000003,158.7442,427.009,168.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"0.2; mean age, 18 weeks) were","rect":[429.42900000000003,158.7442,545.9990000000001,168.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"included. All rabbits completed the study protocol. PCCT im-","rect":[306,146.7442,546.0300000000001,156.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ages were available for all animals, with satisfactory image qual-","rect":[306,134.7442,546.0329999999999,144.7442],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ity at all time points. All data were analyzed.","rect":[306,122.74419999999999,476.65700000000004,132.74419999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"In Vitro Characterization and Imaging of the Polyethylene","rect":[306,98.74419999999999,533.6359999999999,108.74419999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Glycol–coated Gold Nanoparticles","rect":[306,86.74419999999999,447.1479999999999,96.74419999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"The gold nanoparticles used had a core size of 12.5 nm as de-","rect":[306,74.74419999999999,546.0290000000005,84.74419999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"termined with transmission electron microscopy and a mean","rect":[306,62.74419999999999,546.009,72.74419999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"hydrodynamic diameter of 18 nm as determined with dynamic","rect":[306,50.74419999999999,546.0000000000001,60.74419999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Figure 3:","rect":[315,449.6361,346.9040000000001,457.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Photon-counting CT images of atherosclerotic rabbit aortas","rect":[354.744,449.6361,525.7600000000006,457.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"before and 2 days after injection (inj.) of gold nanoparticles.","rect":[315,439.6361,489.36800000000073,447.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"A","rect":[491.07200000000046,439.6361,495.76000000000045,447.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":", Images show","rect":[495.672,439.6361,537.6319999999998,447.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"noncalcified plaque with strong circumferential enhancement and mean wall","rect":[315,429.6361,536.6320000000007,437.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"concentration of 4.5 mg/mL of gold nanoparticles. Parietal calcifications (ar-","rect":[315,419.6361,538.0080000000005,427.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"rowheads) are also shown. Green line in first image indicates aortic section","rect":[315,409.6361,532.8160000000007,417.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"analyzed. Rectangles in Overlay Before inj. and Overlay Day 2 images repre-","rect":[315,399.6361,542.6560000000005,407.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"sent close-up view of parietal wall for better analyzing enhancement.","rect":[315,389.6361,514.9200000000009,397.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"B","rect":[516.6240000000004,389.6361,520.9120000000004,397.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":", Images","rect":[520.8240000000001,389.6361,545.5759999999998,397.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"show calcified plaque with strong enhancement within and around calcified","rect":[315.00000000000006,379.6361,535.0240000000006,387.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"area and mean wall concentration of 2.74 mg/mL of gold nanoparticles.","rect":[315.00000000000006,369.6361,528.2160000000006,377.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Parietal calcifications (arrowheads) are also shown. Green line in first image","rect":[315.00000000000006,359.6361,536.2560000000008,367.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"indicates aortic section analyzed. Spotty areas of enhancement were more","rect":[315.00000000000006,349.6361,532.4320000000008,357.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"discernable on gold k-edge image than on conventional image. Rectangles in","rect":[315.00000000000006,339.6361,541.2320000000005,347.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Overlay Before inj. and Overlay Day 2 images represent a close-up view of","rect":[315.00000000000006,329.6361,536.0240000000006,337.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"parietal wall for better analyzing enhancement.","rect":[315.00000000000006,319.6361,452.16000000000065,327.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"C","rect":[453.8640000000003,319.6361,459.32000000000033,327.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":", Box-and-whisker plot shows","rect":[459.2320000000001,319.6361,544.4000000000001,327.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"quantitative analysis of mean gold concentration found in whole atherosclerotic","rect":[315.0000000000001,309.6361,544.3520000000005,317.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"rabbit abdominal aortic wall before injection (mean concentration, 0.28 mg/","rect":[315.0000000000001,299.6361,539.5120000000007,307.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"mL","rect":[315.0000000000001,289.6361,322.8080000000001,297.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"6","rect":[324.5120000000001,289.6361,331.1760000000001,297.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"0.22; range, 0.01–0.66 mg/mL) and 2 days after injection (mean, 1.07","rect":[332.8800000000001,289.6361,543.7600000000006,297.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"mg/mL","rect":[315.0000000000001,279.6361,336.5520000000002,287.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"6","rect":[338.2560000000001,279.6361,344.9200000000001,287.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"0.36; range, 0.45– 1.56 mg/mL). Lower and upper margins of","rect":[347.0800000000001,279.6361,531.4480000000004,287.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"each box indicate 25th and 75th percentiles. Cross represents mean, and line","rect":[315.0000000000001,269.6361,540.7200000000007,277.6361],"fontSize":8},{"text":"in box represents median. Outliers indicate minimal and maximal values.","rect":[315.0000000000001,259.6361,523.1600000000009,267.6361],"fontSize":8}],"images":[[48,247.91998291015625,546,732]],"segments":[[48,745.5,545.943,745.5],[3